  "contract": "Use the existing per-definition remainingbodyfuel as finite field-telescope lookahead bound. Existing field walker counts live fields, charges erased slots to lookahead, and returns >=65536 on incompletewalk. Productionfuel<=8192 ensures no overflow/sentinelambiguity. Successful count enters unchanged body scan with ORIGINALstate/fuel; no double-charge. The arm scanner consumes actuallambda/Ann nodes. Old64fieldlimit is removed without increasing8192node/4096definition/graphbudgets. Wholegraph still rejects incompleteanalysis.",
  "privateHelperChange": "jd_calls_match_arm accepts all complete fieldcounts<65536 instead of<65. Historical controls of the arbitrary64boundary require successor expectations. Raw malformed arms may still differ; producer is checked code and this is an admissionextension, not equalityofallprivateinputs.",
